*           (K$PASTE.START / K$PASTE.END), and an unbound control sequence read whole to its final byte (decoded for the screen library).
*           And from Linux 0717b335 / d9185318 (S.94's Shift-F keys, S.184 stage 2): kc.alt also returns Esc and a blank, Esc and DEL, and
