* 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 7ff476f (12 Oct 26): ESC [ < (an xterm SGR mouse report) is bound to K$MOUSE.
* 02 Oct 26 Windows port - RELEASE_1.1 120.  F1-F5, Home and End as xterm spells
*           them (ESC O P-S, ESC [ 1 5 ~, ESC [ H, ESC [ F) are bound as defaults,
*           before the terminfo binds.  F1 typed a P.
* 19 Aug 26 Windows port - both Ctrl-H (8) and DEL (127) are bound to
*           K$BACKSPACE as defaults, before the terminfo binds so terminfo still
*           overrides either.  Every Windows console host sends DEL and the
*           default of the day, vt100, said ^H, so the key did nothing out of
