*           for a session that selects another one.
* 22 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 68d6c5e-04f1eaa - kc.alt (BINDKEY action -7): an unbound Esc and one printable character come back as the two characters, an Alt-letter.
* 12 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 68d6c5e-04f1eaa - ESC [ <(an xterm SGR mouse report) is bound to K$MOUSE.
* 14 Sep 26 Windows port - from Linux 68d6c5e-04f1eaa - Both Ctrl-H (8) and DEL (127) are bound to K$BACKSPACE as
*               defaults, before the terminfo binds so terminfo still overrides
